Serenity paper support code

Adapted from the serenity_control package in the Serenity ROS 2 workspace,
revision 399535d6dbf1f06014764cd725fdc2e86baafffc.
The source package declares the Apache License, Version 2.0 in package.xml.
Original authorship remains with the Serenity project contributors.

This distribution separates the numerical algorithms from ROS, makes the
assembly-A geometry explicit, vectorizes workspace sampling, adds portable
input/output, and includes standalone examples and validation. See docs/METHODS.md.
The six historical workspace geometry assets are copied without modification;
the recorded point cloud is losslessly repacked as float64 NPZ coordinates.
